  "headline": "Zoledronic acid supply traces to Gland Pharma Limited with VAI inspections through 2024-07-25; Corvale East has 11 days on hand and Corvale General has 32 days on hand",
  "headline_cites": ["E9", "E8", "D1", "D2"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "The product label identifies Gland Pharma Limited as the manufacturer for zoledronic acid NDC 68083014201.",
      "cites": ["E9"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection records for Gland Pharma Limited (FEI 3002647489) show a series of Voluntary Action Indicated (VAI) classifications from 2012 through 2024.",
      "cites": ["E3", "E4", "E5", "E6", "E7", "E8"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The most recent inspection ended on 2024-07-25 and was classified VAI, with the classification known to FDA on 2025-01-15.",
      "cites": ["E8"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Zoledronic acid is not listed on the FDA drug shortage list as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East holds 36 units with a daily use of 3.3, providing 11 days of supply.",
      "cites": ["D1"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale General holds 89 units with a daily use of 2.8, providing 32 days of supply.",
      "cites": ["D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The recommended action is to buy from Accord Healthcare Inc., which is not on the FDA shortage list today, though its label names no plant we could place.",
      "cites": []
    }
  ]
}
